'''Mummified''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by buying the 4th tier during the [[Halloween Event 2019|2019 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It appears to be the [[Default Knife]] mummified in bandages made out of linen, hence the name.

